# Production build (vite build): call the API with relative URLs so the SPA works
# wherever the backend serves it from (same origin). Used by `make demo` / `make
# demo-lan` and the packaged Electron/Windows build, where the FastAPI backend
# serves frontend/dist as static files on http://<host>:8756.
#
# Leave this EMPTY. An empty value -> client.ts uses relative paths (e.g. /auth/login).
VITE_API_BASE=
